        "![](profile.jpg){.profile fig-alt=\"证件照\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- 🎓 华中农业大学作物遗传改良国家重点实验室 硕士（2023）\n",
        "- 🔬 研究方向：作物分子育种与基因组学\n",
        "- 📚 核心技能：CRISPR基因编辑、生物信息学分析、统计建模\n",
        "- 🌱 当前状态：申请海外农业生物技术博士学位\n"
      ],
      "id": "2c2f1ce4"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "skills = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "    '技术领域': ['分子克隆', '基因组组装', 'QTL定位', 'Python编程'],\n",
        "    '熟练程度': [90, 85, 88, 92]\n",
        "})\n",
        "skills.to_csv('skills.csv', index=False)"
      ],
      "id": "8f53a4ad",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: false\n",
        "library(ggplot2)\n",
        "skills <- read.csv('skills.csv')\n",
        "ggplot(skills, aes(x=技术领域, y=熟练程度)) +\n",
        "  geom_col(fill=\"#3498DB\") +\n",
        "  theme_minimal() +\n",
        "  labs(title=\"技术能力雷达图\") +\n",
        "  coord_polar()"
      ],
      "id": "e530a9a1"
    }
  ],
